25,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Transport costs vary wildly depending on distance. Public beds are cheap, but we must account for everything.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Public bookings are a bureaucratic nightmare. Also, cooking for ourselves on campus is a huge burden on the staff.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It seems the evenings are key for bonding, but we're losing members who don't attend away camps.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Our own hall is overcrowded during vacation. Also, inland centers can be very cramped with strict rules.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Whole-building lets are risky if people cancel. Also, many members can't commute to campus early enough.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, if public bookings are that difficult, maybe we should avoid the Mountain Centre.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The administrative load is too high for the organizers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, if the hall is crowded, Campus Intensive might not be viable for training quality.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,Exactly. The split schedule would be exhausting and inefficient.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if we go for a private lodge, the non-refundable deposits could create a financial mess.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, that is a valid concern. We cannot afford another budget deficit.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Minako, if we want people to bond, we need a place where everyone stays together.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Minako,,"That suggests a dedicated lodge or center, but we need to ensure people actually show up.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The inland centers sound like they might lead to poor sleep, which ruins the training.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"So the Campus option has commute and scheduling issues, and the Mountain option is a logistical pain.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The Coastal Lodge is new to us, but it offers a whole building.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"It removes the cooking duty, which is a huge relief for the organizers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Minako,,And it provides the shared environment the seniors recommended for mixing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,As long as the sleeping arrangements are better than eight to a room.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We just have to be very strict about the headcount and the payment terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
