50,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I'm leaning toward the Coastal Lodge, provided we fix the payment structure.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I vote for the Coastal Lodge. It saves the organizers from the cooking and lottery stress.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Minako,,I agree. The Coastal Lodge is the best bet for social cohesion.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll support the Coastal Lodge. It avoids the hall's congestion and the inland center's rigidity.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"I'm hesitant about the deposits, but the other two options have too many flaws. I vote Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,It seems we are in agreement.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
